Package: alchemeR
Title: Archive 'Alchemer' Survey Data and Load It Into an Analytics
    Database
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Rousell", "Greg", , "grousell@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Jason", "Locklin", , "locklin.jason@gmail.com", role = "ctb"))
Description: Copies an 'Alchemer' account into a local 'DuckLake' database --
  surveys, questions, and responses kept verbatim as an archive, and republished
  as tidy typed tables -- and optionally on into an analytics database over a
  'DBI' connection, forming a scheduled extract-load-transform pipeline. Also
  provides direct access to the 'Alchemer' API. 'Alchemer'
  <https://www.alchemer.com/> is an online survey and data collection software
  platform. See <https://apihelp.alchemer.com/help> for more information about
  their API. This package is community-maintained and is not officially
  supported by 'Alchemer'.
